  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/dglf/261",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">2025학년도에는&#160;<br>&#39;TCA 회로&#39; 과학 연극 시나리오를 소개하고<br>모둠별로 연극을 해보는 활동을 했습니다.<br><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/dglf/229\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/dglf/229</a><br>&#160;<br>올해는 연극 시나리오 짝활동을 했습니다.<br>1. 제공한 시나리오를 짝끼리 번갈아 한줄씩 읽으면서 빈칸 채우기<br>2. 이 시나리오와 관련된 문항을 2개 만들기<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>이 활동을 마치고,<br>TCA 과학동시 짓기 활동을 하였습니다.<br>1. 챗GPT를 활용하여 동시짓기<br>2. 동시 해설하기<br>&#160;<br>결과는<br>너무 좋은데요!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/35e32d7df10b398c54343d8386f9ec6479db1390\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"604\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/35e32d7df10b398c54343d8386f9ec6479db1390\" data-origin-width=\"1124\" data-origin-height=\"1405\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">-----------------------------------<br>&#160;<br>이 멋진 과학동시로 문항을 만들 수 있을까? 궁금했습니다.<br>그래서<br>&#39;재과만 고교 생명과학 평가문항 생성기&#39;에&#160;<br><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/I6d/296\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/I6d/296</a></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>이 사진을 넣고, 생명과학 문항을 만들어 달라고 했습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3ff98d18c803380ceab46e9376e182115998163a\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"387\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3ff98d18c803380ceab46e9376e182115998163a\" data-origin-width=\"498\" data-origin-height=\"688\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">두둥~<br>이제 AI 문항 생성기가<br>어떤 문항들을 생성해주는지 살펴보시죠~&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d0feb1355953b98533ae1568761759fc387f31b8\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"650\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d0feb1355953b98533ae1568761759fc387f31b8\" data-origin-width=\"768\" data-origin-height=\"439\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4deb301b03a2139d7a9983958fe09081a2495cf8\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"650\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4deb301b03a2139d7a9983958fe09081a2495cf8\" data-origin-width=\"772\" data-origin-height=\"451\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c692fd05b00632e576fbc0ed47a8e59d777215bb\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"650\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c692fd05b00632e576fbc0ed47a8e59d777215bb\" data-origin-width=\"759\" data-origin-height=\"426\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/56ded7df417de68f0f3d800b7599a316a0683b9b\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"650\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/56ded7df417de68f0f3d800b7599a316a0683b9b\" data-origin-width=\"759\" data-origin-height=\"564\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/666543df1a9e99c12608f8420f1fbb492b7e3bb3\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"650\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/666543df1a9e99c12608f8420f1fbb492b7e3bb3\" data-origin-width=\"769\" data-origin-height=\"555\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;<br>AI가 만들어준<br>이 5개의 문항을 보면서&#160; &#160;Wow&#160; &#39;ㅁ&#160; 쳤 다! &#39;&#160; 감탄만 하게 됩니다!</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">전자전달계를 AI가 시를 문항으로 제작한 사례도 공유합니다~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9e6513082ba18e9e095825e6ed8cc67c0a6d29c1\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" height=\"888\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9e6513082ba18e9e095825e6ed8cc67c0a6d29c1\" data-origin-width=\"901\" data-origin-height=\"1600\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/87d24ef1827e74cdbbe7c7c9427b83d2b8d06229\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"650\" height=\"340\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/87d24ef1827e74cdbbe7c7c9427b83d2b8d06229\" data-origin-width=\"770\" data-origin-height=\"403\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d04566767488021a3df4ff2605cc8652065c8925\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"650\" height=\"416\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d04566767488021a3df4ff2605cc8652065c8925\" data-origin-width=\"777\" data-origin-height=\"497\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
